  partName: Cover Plate
  description: The Cover Plate is a small, thin-flat metal component located at the
    middle-center-rear of the engine, serving as a protective cover for internal
    components. Made of mid-tone metal, this plate helps to prevent debris and contaminants
    from entering the engine while also providing easy access for maintenance and
    repairs. Notably, its small size and rear positioning make it a critical component
    for ensuring the engine's overall durability.
